Package: nmr.parser
Title: Reading What is Required from NMR IVDr Data
Version: 0.3.9
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given = "Julien",
           family = "Wist",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "julien.wist@murdoch.edu.au",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3416-2572")),
      person(given = "Reika",
           family = "Masuda",
           role = c("aut"),
           email = "reika.masuda@murdoch.edu.au"))
Description: Reads Bruker IVDr NMR data into R: acquisition and processing
    parameters, processed spectra placed on a common chemical shift grid and
    corrected for ERETIC, experiment titles, and the XML reports Bruker
    produces for small molecule quantification, lipoprotein subfractions,
    PACS and quality control. Lipoprotein results can be extended with the
    total lipid, cholesterol ester, composition and distribution parameters
    derived from them.
